  "description": "Violet Everdeen is known as the worst magician in the academy and she is an a illegitimate child from a noble family. Her home life and school life are awful. Suddenly, she gains the power to see visions of the future. The future seen, is a villainess, and an excution. Knowing this, she makes plans to avoid her death and the villainess label.\n\n[Original Novel](https://series.naver.com/novel/detail.series?productNo=13518828)\n\n**Original Webtoon:**     \n[KakaoPage](https://page.kakao.com/content/69117162), [Daum](https://webtoon.kakao.com/content/%EB%B0%94%EC%9D%B4%EC%98%AC%EB%A0%9B%EC%9D%98-%ED%95%9C%EB%A7%88%EB%94%94/4841)\n\n **Official Translations:**    \n[Japanese](https://jp.piccoma.com/web/product/200923)",
